@startuml
title Workplace Migration State Machine

[*] --> Scheduled

Scheduled --> Ready : readiness confirmed
Scheduled --> Postponed : postponement approved
Scheduled --> Blocked : blocker identified

Ready --> MigrationInProgress : migration started
Ready --> Postponed : postponement approved
Ready --> Blocked : blocker identified

Postponed --> Scheduled : new migration date assigned
Postponed --> Blocked : blocker identified

Blocked --> Scheduled : blocker resolved\nand new date assigned
Blocked --> Ready : blocker resolved\nand readiness confirmed

MigrationInProgress --> Migrated : automated migration successful
MigrationInProgress --> ManualMigrationRequired : automated migration failed
MigrationInProgress --> DualBoot : migration completed\nwith unresolved Windows dependency

ManualMigrationRequired --> Migrated : manual migration successful
ManualMigrationRequired --> Blocked : manual migration cannot proceed

DualBoot --> Migrated : Windows dependency removed
DualBoot --> Blocked : new blocking dependency identified

Migrated --> FullyOperational : operational validation completed

FullyOperational --> [*]

state Scheduled
state Ready
state Postponed
state Blocked
state MigrationInProgress
state ManualMigrationRequired
state DualBoot
state Migrated
state FullyOperational

@enduml